  m_text: 'MOVE          WASD or Arrow Keys / Left Stick

    INTERACT      E or
    Space, when a prompt is on screen / Gamepad A

    ADVANCE TEXT  Space or Enter
    while reading narrative

    PAUSE         Esc


    Walk up to glowing objects
    to see a prompt, then interact to reveal Lucille''s story.

    Golden sparks
    mark memory fragments - optional details that add depth to the story.

    Complete
    every objective shown in the top-left HUD to move on to the next chapter.'
